# Body and fear
rec:
What the record shows | Restrained, guarded, observant, and out of step with the room's performance. His stillness is specific (WR 36). His attention travels through a room to the cameras and the exits (WR 37). He's learned to route around his own security detail (CR).
What he's afraid will happen | INFERENCE: Choosing, and having the choice be the Empire's.
