/end

@page rh="THE HOUSE OF VANE · JUDAH · EXCAVATION · THE PAIRING" m="TKC: TR; WRITING"
# Thirty minutes
A Crown advisor, a Vowed officer, a camera outside the door, and an unrecorded room. He sends the officials out. He checks her for a wire. She tells him she wants the kind of power that changes things. He's quiet for four seconds. "Most candidates tell me they feel called." "I know." He looks at her a little longer than the format allows, then asks his next question (TR).
